  "body": "Wake to panoramic Hauraki Gulf views and wind down with breath-taking coastal sunsets. Positioned directly opposite Orewa Primary School on a prime 793sqm freehold section, this solid concrete block & weatherboard 7-bedroom, 5-bathroom architectural masterpiece delivers luxury living on a grand scale.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to pool multi-generational family wealth, establish an elite work-from-home business base, or find a secure haven for a major car collection, this multi-level layout offers unmatched versatility.\r\n\r\nTHE SHOWROOM GARAGING & PARKING (Rare 14-Vehicle Capacity) An absolute dream for car collectors, boat owners, or tradespeople requiring massive storage. The property features an expansive 6-car internal garage/workshop plus secure, off-street parking for an additional 8 vehicles within a private, water-featured courtyard compound.\r\n\r\nGROUND FLOOR: The Independent Wing Perfectly configured for extended family, grandparents, teenagers, or a premium home office setup. Features two substantial bedrooms with dedicated study alcoves and a shared semi-ensuite.\r\n\r\nFIRST LEVEL: World-Class Entertaining & Main Living The heart of the home centers around a high-tech home theatre/media room (equipped with projector, electronic screen, and built-in sound system). The premium open-plan kitchen and dining area flows seamlessly through wide sliding doors to an expansive, sun-drenched sea-view balcony. A second massive lounge features an integrated speaker system with full 'party mode' audio capability. This level also includes a master wing with ensuite, plus two additional family bedrooms sharing a semi-ensuite.\r\n\r\nTOP LEVEL: The Parents' Ultimate Penthouse Retreat Boasting the most spectacular, uninterrupted ocean views in Orewa. This floor offers a vast second lounge with a built-in drinks bar, study nook, and large bifold windows capturing the sea breezes. The master retreat features its own private balcony, walk-in wardrobe, plus an additional guest bedroom and bathroom.\r\n\r\nPREMIUM SPECIFICATIONS: Commercial-grade comfort with underfloor heating, independent heat pumps on every floor, full CCTV security system, and an oversized laundry setup equipped with space for extra appliances and dual built-in study desks.\r\n\r\nProperties of this monumental scale, solid build quality, and extreme parking capacity are virtually impossible to find on the Hibiscus Coast. This is an absolute must-see.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
